;. /project_sources_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition project_sources
  ;= Project evidence into authored pages
    Accept an explicit flow/page tree and decoded sources. Produce Nenex document records retaining the source and data. This procedure neither fetches nor guesses page structure. Select the Nenex writer only when document publication is intended.
    Publish this procedure independently. Invoke it alone using the retain_result
    writer to inspect its work cells, or select it in another authored flow.

    ;@ /flow/input pages
    ;= pages

    ;@ /flow/input sources
    ;= sources

    ;@ /flow/step projected ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/library/project_sources
    ;@ /flow/bind pages pages
    ;@ /flow/bind sources sources
    ;= projected

    ;@ /flow/result projected
    ;= Retained result
